			<div class="content" id="post-content-1520730">
									

<p>Hey Swampless! Good to see your SCP up.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Living fused and/or mutilated copies and copies that block each others' paths, will still attempt to the best of their ability to mimic</p>
</blockquote>
<p>You don't need the comma here.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Should the subject die, they and all their copies, and any remains, of the copies, will disappear.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>You don't need some commas here. 'Should the subject die, they, all their copies, and any remains will disappear'.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>there were over a 16 thousand copies</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Remove 'a'</p>
<p>I don't really think you need the doctor's note, but I like this one. I also think it'd be a great place to do some synchronized dancing in. Just imagine Thriller in here!</p>

